            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Set appropriate [`config.symbol`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cd3a08fbf987dabcfded35ebb612e82f8000f92a/doc/mini-indentscope.txt#L164). For example, like this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.indentscope').setup({ symbol = '│' })\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere is a [good reference for other symbols](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Box-drawing_characters). Also note that their visual appearance depends on how terminal emulator displays them (so not 100% that they will have no space in between cells).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Set appropriate <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/cd3a08fbf987dabcfded35ebb612e82f8000f92a/doc/mini-indentscope.txt#L164\"><code class=\"notranslate\">config.symbol</code></a>. For example, like this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require('mini.indentscope').setup({ symbol = '│' })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>mini.indentscope<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">symbol</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>│<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span>})</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Here is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Box-drawing_characters\" rel=\"nofollow\">good reference for other symbols</a>. Also note that their visual appearance depends on how terminal emulator displays them (so not 100% that they will have no space in between cells).</p>",
            "bodyText": "Set appropriate config.symbol. For example, like this:\nrequire('mini.indentscope').setup({ symbol = '│' })\nHere is a good reference for other symbols. Also note that their visual appearance depends on how terminal emulator displays them (so not 100% that they will have no space in between cells).",
